### iOS v67.264: Float Physics & Isometric Projection

On the latest iOS binary, the coordinate system transitions into **32-bit Floats** during the physics and collision resolution phase. Furthermore, Brawl Stars uses a **2:1 Isometric Projection**. The engine converts logical coordinates into screen/render coordinates using a specific mathematical scaler.

#### Collision & Hitbox Detection

The collision engine iterates through entity arrays to check for intersections. The exact hitbox radius for projectiles and melee attacks is hardcoded as a float comparison against `105.6`.

```c
